colon mode
==========
:q --> Quit
:wq --> write and quit
:q! --> quit forcely
:set nu --> set line numbers
:set nonu --> remove line number
:20 --> it will take to line number 20
:/<word-to-search> --> It will search for the word in forward search
:?<word-to-search> --> back word search (bottom to top)
:noh --> do not hightlight the word
:2d --> it will delete line 2
:5,10d --> it will delete lines from 5 to 10
:%d --> delete entire content in the file
:3s/<word-to-search>/<word-to-substitute> 
:3s/sbin/SBIN --> it will find the sbin word in 3rd line and replace it with SBIN. By default it will replace only first occurence
:3s/sbin/SBIN/g --> it will find the sbin word in 3rd line and replace it with SBIN at all occurence
:%/sbin/SBIN/g --> it will replace with SBIN in entire file

Esc Mode
========
gg --> takes to first line of file
shift+g --> takes to bottom line of the file
u --> undo
ctrl+r --> redo
yy --> copy the current line
p --> paste the copied line
dd --> it will cut/delete the current line

